{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     home/stats — counts, and every one of them is real.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     {{pagination.total}} inside a {{#get}} is the collection's true size, not
     the number of records fetched — which is why each cell asks for limit=1.
     Fetching a page of posts to count them would be the same query at fifty
     times the cost.

     NSDS's own statband example shows "1,482 learners · 74% completion".
     Neither is available to a Ghost theme, and both are the kind of number
     that gets typed in once and is wrong forever. These four come out of the
     database on every render or they do not appear at all.

     The band hides itself when the site is empty: "0 posts · 0 topics" is
     worse than silence on a site that has just launched.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
{{#get "posts" limit="1" as |allPosts|}}
    {{#if allPosts}}
        <section class="ns-band ns-band--tight">
            <div class="ns-band__inner">
                <dl class="ns-statband">

                    <div class="ns-statband__cell">
                        <dd class="ns-statband__value">{{pagination.total}}</dd>
                        <dt class="ns-statband__label">{{t "Published"}}</dt>
                    </div>

                    {{#get "tags" limit="1"}}
                        <div class="ns-statband__cell">
                            <dd class="ns-statband__value">{{pagination.total}}</dd>
                            <dt class="ns-statband__label">{{t "Topics"}}</dt>
                        </div>
                    {{/get}}

                    {{#get "authors" limit="1"}}
                        <div class="ns-statband__cell">
                            <dd class="ns-statband__value">{{pagination.total}}</dd>
                            <dt class="ns-statband__label">{{t "Writers"}}</dt>
                        </div>
                    {{/get}}

                    {{#get "pages" limit="1"}}
                        <div class="ns-statband__cell">
                            <dd class="ns-statband__value">{{pagination.total}}</dd>
                            <dt class="ns-statband__label">{{t "Pages"}}</dt>
                        </div>
                    {{/get}}

                </dl>
            </div>
        </section>
    {{/if}}
{{/get}}
